/*!
\page page_stDcaGeometry StDcaGeometry

\brief Track geometry (helix parameters) at the point of closest approach to the beam line.

\ref StDcaGeometry stores the compact five-parameter helix representation of a global
reconstructed track at the point of closest approach (DCA) to the nominal beam line (z-axis).
It is produced by the track fitter (Sti/StiCA or equivalent) for each global track and embedded
inside \c StGlobalTrack (or \c StPrimaryTrack) as the \c dcaGeometry() object. The class also
carries the full 5×5 parameter covariance matrix packed as 15 upper-triangle floats.

\section sec_dca_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\verbatim
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StDcaGeometry     (concrete — this class)
\endverbatim

\ref StDcaGeometry objects are embedded by value inside global and primary track objects; they
are not held in a separate collection.

\section sec_dca_params Helix Parameterisation

Five parameters describe the track at the DCA point:

| Parameter | Symbol | Field | Accessor | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Signed impact parameter | d₀ | mImp | impact() | Signed transverse distance from beam line (cm). Sign: x = −d₀ sin ψ, y = d₀ cos ψ. |
| z at DCA | z₀ | mZ | z() | z-coordinate of DCA in STAR global frame (cm). |
| Azimuthal momentum angle | ψ | mPsi | psi() | Momentum azimuthal angle at DCA (rad). |
| Signed inverse p_T | 1/p_T | mPti | pt(), charge() | (GeV/c)⁻¹; sign = sign(−qB). charge() = −1 if mPti>0, else +1. |
| Tangent of dip angle | tan λ | mTan | tanDip(), dipAngle() | p_z/p_T; dipAngle() = arctan(mTan) in rad. |
| Signed curvature | κ | mCurv | curvature(), hz() | κ = qBc/p_T (cm⁻¹); hz() = mCurv/mPti = |Bc|. |

3-D position at DCA: x = −mImp·sin(mPsi), y = mImp·cos(mPsi), z = mZ.

3-D momentum at DCA: p_x = p_T·cos(mPsi), p_y = p_T·sin(mPsi), p_z = p_T·mTan.

\section sec_dca_covariance Covariance Matrix

The 5×5 covariance (parameter order: mImp, mZ, mPsi, mPti, mTan) is stored as 15
upper-triangle floats:

\verbatim
[0]  mImpImp      Var(d₀)
[1]  mZImp        Cov(z₀,d₀)
[2]  mZZ          Var(z₀)
[3]  mPsiImp      Cov(ψ,d₀)
[4]  mPsiZ        Cov(ψ,z₀)
[5]  mPsiPsi      Var(ψ)
[6]  mPtiImp      Cov(1/p_T,d₀)
[7]  mPtiZ        Cov(1/p_T,z₀)
[8]  mPtiPsi      Cov(1/p_T,ψ)
[9]  mPtiPti      Var(1/p_T)
[10] mTanImp      Cov(tanλ,d₀)
[11] mTanZ        Cov(tanλ,z₀)
[12] mTanPsi      Cov(tanλ,ψ)
[13] mTanPti      Cov(tanλ,1/p_T)
[14] mTanTan      Var(tanλ)
\endverbatim

Accessible via <tt>errMatrix()</tt>.

\section sec_dca_members Data Members

- <tt>Char_t mBeg[1]</tt> — <b>Transient</b> sentinel marking the start of zero-init block.
- <tt>Float_t mImp</tt> — Signed impact parameter d₀ (cm).
- <tt>Float_t mZ</tt> — z at DCA (cm).
- <tt>Float_t mPsi</tt> — Azimuthal momentum angle ψ (rad).
- <tt>Float_t mPti</tt> — Signed inverse p_T (GeV/c)⁻¹.
- <tt>Float_t mTan</tt> — Tangent of dip angle = p_z/p_T.
- <tt>Float_t mCurv</tt> — Signed curvature κ (cm⁻¹).
- <tt>Float_t mImpImp, mZImp, mZZ, mPsiImp, mPsiZ, mPsiPsi, mPtiImp, mPtiZ, mPtiPsi,
  mPtiPti, mTanImp, mTanZ, mTanPsi, mTanPti, mTanTan</tt> — 15-element upper-triangle
  covariance matrix.
- <tt>Char_t mEnd[1]</tt> — <b>Transient</b> sentinel marking the end of zero-init block.

\section sec_dca_methods Key Methods

- <tt>Int_t charge() const</tt> — Electric charge: −1 if mPti>0, else +1.
- <tt>Double_t impact() const</tt> — d₀ (cm).
- <tt>Double_t z() const</tt> — z at DCA (cm).
- <tt>Double_t psi() const</tt> — ψ (rad).
- <tt>Double_t tanDip() const</tt> — tan λ = p_z/p_T.
- <tt>Double_t dipAngle() const</tt> — arctan(tanDip) (rad).
- <tt>Double_t pt() const</tt> — p_T = 1/|mPti| (GeV/c).
- <tt>Double_t curvature() const</tt> — κ (cm⁻¹).
- <tt>Double_t hz() const</tt> — mCurv/mPti = |Bc|.
- <tt>StThreeVectorF origin() const</tt> — 3-D DCA position (cm).
- <tt>StThreeVectorF momentum() const</tt> — 3-D momentum (GeV/c).
- <tt>StPhysicalHelixD helix() const</tt> — Converts to StPhysicalHelixD for geometry.
- <tt>THelixTrack thelix() const</tt> — Converts to THelixTrack with XY and SZ error matrices.
- <tt>const float* params() const</tt> — Pointer to 6-element array [imp, z, psi, pti, tan, curv].
- <tt>const float* errMatrix() const</tt> — Pointer to 15-element covariance array.
- <tt>void set(const Float_t pars[6], const Float_t errs[15])</tt> — Set all parameters (float).
- <tt>void set(const Double_t pars[6], const Double_t errs[15])</tt> — Set all parameters (double).
- <tt>void GetXYZ(Double_t xyzp[6], Double_t CovXyzp[21]) const</tt> — Transform to Cartesian
  (x, y, z, p_x, p_y, p_z) with full 6×6 covariance (21 upper-triangle elements) via the
  analytical Jacobian.

\section sec_dca_ownership Object Ownership

\ref StDcaGeometry is embedded <b>by value</b> inside the owning track object. No special
allocation or deallocation is needed.

\section sec_dca_usage Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StGlobalTrack* gTrack = /* ... */;
const StDcaGeometry* dca = gTrack->dcaGeometry();
if (!dca) return;

std::cout << "q="    << dca->charge()
          << " pT="  << dca->pt()  << " GeV/c"
          << " d0="  << dca->impact() << " cm"
          << " z0="  << dca->z() << " cm"
          << " psi=" << dca->psi() << " rad\n";

const float* err = dca->errMatrix();
double sigmaD0 = (err[0] >= 0) ? TMath::Sqrt(err[0]) : -1.0;

// Cartesian conversion with full covariance
double xyzp[6], cov[21];
dca->GetXYZ(xyzp, cov);
\endcode

\sa \ref page_sthit, \ref page_stTpcHit
*/
